sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Developer / CLI
    participant CLI as arc-runner CLI
    participant Importer as OllamaImporter
    participant Registry as OllamaRegistryClient
    participant Transpiler as GGUFTranspiler
    participant Math as QuantizationMathEngine
    participant Synth as OpenVINOGraphSynthesizer
    participant Storage as Local Cache & Models

    User->>CLI: arc-runner pull ollama:qwen2.5:3b
    CLI->>Importer: pull_and_transpile("qwen2.5:3b")
    Importer->>Registry: fetch_manifest("qwen2.5:3b")
    Registry->>Registry: parse_model_tag -> library, qwen2.5, 3b
    Registry->>Registry: get_bearer_token()
    Registry-->>Importer: OllamaManifestResponseDto (layer digests & sizes)
    Importer->>Registry: stream_blob(digest="sha256:...")
    Registry->>Storage: Stream chunked bytes with Range header & SHA-256 verify
    Storage-->>Importer: blob_path (.gguf container)
    Importer->>Transpiler: transpile(blob_path, precision="int4")
    loop For each GGUF tensor
        Transpiler->>Math: dequantize non-native k-quant (Q4_0 / Q4_K) to FP32
        Transpiler->>Math: repack_to_intel_symmetric_int4(Group 128)
        Transpiler->>Math: align_to_cacheline(32 bytes)
        Transpiler->>Math: calculate_sqnr() -> verify >= 20.0 dB
        Transpiler->>Storage: Write aligned INT4 tensor to model.bin
    end
    Transpiler->>Synth: synthesize(tensor_layout, "openvino_model")
    Synth->>Synth: _validate_kahn_topological_sort() O(V+E)
    Synth->>Storage: Write openvino_model.xml (DAG Parameter -> SDPA -> Result)
    Synth->>Storage: Write openvino_tokenizer.xml, detokenizer.xml
    Synth->>Storage: Write generation_config.json, config.json
    Synth-->>Transpiler: GraphSynthesisArtifactsDto
    Transpiler-->>Importer: TranspilationResult
    Importer-->>CLI: Model directory ready
    CLI-->>User: [bold green] Model successfully pulled and transpiled!
